= Rights of Unions

WIP


@fiscal_menu

- @encourage_unions: Encourage workers to join unions, and speed up union elections.
- @ban_actions_stopping_forming_unions: Persecute corporations accused of union-busting activity
- @pass_pro_act: Can we pass the PRO act?
- @root: Do not change the tax system.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@encourage_unions
subtitle: Increasing the power of organized labor will help us in elections, assuming unions mantain their support for the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Democrat Party**</span>
on-arrival: socialist_strength +=2; socialist_dissent -=2; union_bonus +=1

WIP

@ban_actions_stopping_forming_unions
subtitle: Corporations are attempting to stop their workers from joining unions through mandating anti-union propaganda amongst their workers, and outright firing those who attempt to start one.
on-arrival: labor_loyalty +=5; socialist_strength +=2; socialist_dissent -=2

WIP

@pass_pro_act
subtitle: +2 budget
choose-if: filibuster_gone = 1
max-visits: 1
unavailable-subtitle: This would never survive the fillibuster
on-arrival: budget += 2; workers_spd -= 4; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; lower_tax_rates += 1; workers_spd -= 5 if lower_tax_rates >= 2; new_liberal_dissent += 3; socialist_dissent += 3

We have raised taxes for the poor and working class. This hurts our support among the workers.
